Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyIntersectionIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Other vehicle passing through intersection" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle in close proximity/lane intrusion" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle performing an unsafe close maneuver in poor visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Lane Intrusion Risk due to the proximity of the red vehicle to the ego-vehicle's path in extremely low visibility conditions caused by fog and rain.
Severity Score: 0.75